      "value": "World name is needed here too, and also which #channel number. So i can see if right world is loaded and not by accident switched. \nAlso useful when i am \"knocked\" out and suddenly loading another world. Where am i heading now?\n\nAdd world name is very requested option in loading screen.\nDon't forget if you are invited by other, you see ONLY world name, but you will miss world description / text. So you will come for example in unknown world and you have no clue what you can do.",
