  "details": "When the level is loading, aside from showing the player the data usage and helpful hints on how to use VRC, have the loading screen show a print out of the level title, description and level artist.\n\nlike:\nNow loading: The Great Pug -\nCome and join us in the great pug to have a good time.\nCreated by: OwlBoy\n\nTo avoid any accidental texts appearing on the loading screen (some devs used the comments section in the sdk for notes on the level) Have the description only be displayed once a special \"Display description upon loading\" tickbox has been ticked in the uploader or in the \"uploaded content\" panel. (similar to setting a avatar private/public)",
